      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if there\u0027s a way to reduce the wall time init latency, as that will slow down every application that imports this package.\n\nWe have the internal infra for lazy-loading certificates but we did not expose any of it, did we? Maaaaybe a build-tagged linkname trick would be justifiable?",
